title: DVP Congress
subtitle: DVP holds another congress for leadership...
tags: event
view-if: (year = 1929 and month = 12 and stresemann_dead and not trigger_stresemann_event_fix) and dvp_votes > 0
new-page: true
on-arrival: dvp_congress_timer = 48; trigger_stresemann_event_fix = 1

= Post Stresemann congress

Following the death of the Gustav Stresemann, greatest poltician of the Weimar period, DVP's volkspartei / left wing has been considerably weakened and could hope to win only through the intensive co-operation and grassroot works. On the other side, Ernst Scholz, candidate of the majority of national liberals and industrialist interests, whose opposition to the liberal unification and indifference to the youth movements have made himself enemies in the face of youth movements and labor unions.

Perhaps, there could rise another compromise candidates, but one wouldn't be so sure.

- @winner_dvp_1929_congress: And the power gains...

@winner_dvp_1929_congress
on-arrival: {!

Q.dvp_curtius = 0;
Q.dvp_luther = 0;
Q.dvp_scholz = 0;
Q.dvp_dingeldey = 0;

var left = Q.dvp_left;
var right = Q.dvp_right;
var total = left + right;
var margin = total > 0 ? (right - left) / total : 0;
// ==========================================
// 5. FINAL OUTCOME ROUTER EVALUATION
// ==========================================
if (margin <= -0.10) {
    Q.dvp_successor_outcome = "curtius_victory";
    Q.dvp_party_leader = "Julius Curtius";
    Q.dvp_ideology = "National Liberalism";
} else if (margin < 0) {
    Q.dvp_successor_outcome = "luther_victory";
    Q.dvp_party_leader = "Hans Luther";
    Q.dvp_ideology = "National Liberalism";
} else if (margin >= 0.10) {
    Q.dvp_successor_outcome = "scholz_victory";
    Q.dvp_party_leader = "Ernst Scholz";
    Q.dvp_ideology = "National Liberalism (Scholzite)";
} else {
    Q.dvp_successor_outcome = "eduard_victory";
    Q.dvp_party_leader = "Eduard Dingeldey";
    Q.dvp_ideology = "National Liberalism (Dingeldist)";
}

!}
go-to: curtius_victory if dvp_successor_outcome = "curtius_victory"; luther_victory if dvp_successor_outcome = "luther_victory"; scholz_victory if dvp_successor_outcome = "scholz_victory"; eduard_victory if dvp_successor_outcome = "eduard_victory"

@curtius_victory
